# Verify before wrapping up

After editing any of these modules, run:

`npm run test:run`

Implementation refactors that preserve behavior should leave tests unchanged and passing. Add or change tests only when **behavior** changes (see `testing-vitest.mdc`). This applies most literally to `LabelComposer.golden.test.ts` and its snapshot file: a changed snapshot means a deliberate, called-out output change requiring sign-off, not a file to regenerate with `vitest -u` because it happened to fail.
